  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a user choosing an accent in « Thème », I want the dark preview's quote to be legible, so that I can judge my accent: \"Une citation\" is drawn in `nightAccent` (`ThemeSettingsView.swift:172-173`), 2.24:1 at hue 240 degrees (found while handling the review of #1389, same class as #1374 outside the reader).\n\n### Scope\n\nText in `nightAccent` (and the light preview's `dayAccent` equivalent, if any) on the preview surface: use `ThemeAppearance.linkColor(dark:)` (added by #1389) for the text, keep the accent for dots and fills.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- The preview's quote text reaches 4.5:1 on its surface at every hue, light and dark; a unit test on the colour used.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
